## Low-Stock Alerts

**Alert when stock < reorder_point.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Trigger alert on low stock
class Material:
    async def receive(self, qty: Decimal) -> None:
        """Receive material and check stock level."""
        self.quantity += qty
        
        # Check if now above reorder point (alert cleared)
        if self.quantity > self.reorder_point:
            self.events.append(LowStockAlertClearedEvent(self.id))
    
    async def consume(self, qty: Decimal) -> None:
        """Consume material and check if low."""
        self.quantity -= qty
        
        # Check if now below reorder point (alert triggered)
        if self.quantity < self.reorder_point:
            self.events.append(LowStockAlertTriggeredEvent(
                material_id=self.id,
                current_qty=self.quantity,
                reorder_point=self.reorder_point
            ))
```

