## Quality Control Rules

**Inspections required for incoming materials.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: QC workflow
class QCInspection:
    status: QCStatus  # PENDING, IN_PROGRESS, PASSED, FAILED
    
    async def start_inspection(self) -> None:
        if self.status != QCStatus.PENDING:
            raise InvalidStateTransitionError()
        self.status = QCStatus.IN_PROGRESS
    
    async def pass_inspection(self) -> None:
        if self.status != QCStatus.IN_PROGRESS:
            raise InvalidStateTransitionError()
        self.status = QCStatus.PASSED
        # Release materials for use
        await self.inventory.release_quarantine(self.material_id)
    
    async def fail_inspection(self) -> None:
        if self.status != QCStatus.IN_PROGRESS:
            raise InvalidStateTransitionError()
        self.status = QCStatus.FAILED
        # Materials remain quarantined
        self.events.append(QCFailedEvent(self.id))
```

