## Sales Order Approval

**Orders require approval before manufacturing.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Approval workflow
class SalesOrder:
    status: SalesOrderStatus  # DRAFT, APPROVED, MANUFACTURING, DELIVERED
    
    async def approve(self) -> None:
        if self.status != SalesOrderStatus.DRAFT:
            raise InvalidStateTransitionError()
        self.status = SalesOrderStatus.APPROVED
        self.events.append(SalesOrderApprovedEvent(self.id))
    
    async def start_manufacturing(self) -> None:
        if self.status != SalesOrderStatus.APPROVED:
            raise InvalidStateTransitionError()
        # Create work orders...
        self.status = SalesOrderStatus.MANUFACTURING
```

