## Soft Deletes (Mandatory)

**Never hard delete. Mark as deleted.**

```python
# ✅ CORRECT: Soft delete
class Material:
    is_deleted: bool = False
    deleted_at: datetime | None = None
    
    async def delete(self) -> None:
        self.is_deleted = True
        self.deleted_at = datetime.utcnow()
        await repo.save(self)

# ❌ WRONG: Hard delete
async def delete(material_id):
    await db.execute(f"DELETE FROM materials WHERE id = {material_id}")
```

